     Talkman 1440x2560 @ 564 dpi is ~726 dp tall, so this config wins.
     Stock res-keyguard/values-h650dp sets widget_big_font_size back to 54dp.
     Do not also define 76dp under values/: aapt2 drops the duplicate and
     stock 54dp wins again.
